,"session_date":"2023-10-19","session_datetime":"2023-10-19T10:11:00","session_id":"session_24","session_index":24,"source_sha256":"536f4d60768c824e4fa5f6c0551f153b46908d30a33d0974956d945f5b01ffb0","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":21}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s3","store_snapshot_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","text":"- As of 2023-05-31, he had been touring with Frank Ocean the week before (~2023-05-22/28) and called it \"wild\"; the Tokyo show was \"unreal\" — the crowd was \"insane\" — and performing \"felt so alive\" he \"can't find the words to express it\"; the energy and love from the fans was \"crazy\" [S7T1][S7T3]. This was the Frank Ocean tour his planned Boston trip was to follow (see the Boston trip section below); as of 2023-05-31, Boston is a stop on this tour itself.\n- On 2023-08-14, updated Dave that the tour with the well-known artist (the Frank Ocean tour, see above) ended with a show in Japan — the Tokyo show was \"awesome\": everyone was \"so into it\" when he played one of his songs and sang along, which he called \"a magical moment\"; feeling of performing and connecting with the audience \"was unreal\"; after the tour he had the opportunity to explore his new place (the Japanese mansion, see ## New home (2023-03-23)) — \"it's like a dream come true!\" [S14T4][S14T6].\n- On 2023-08-31, when Dave asked how the end of the tour was, Calvin said the tour was amazing — he was \"so pumped from all the energy from the audience\" — and shared a photo of a crowd watching a concert with a large screen (\"This pic totally captures how I felt. Such an amazing time!\"); when Dave asked how it was performing on that big stage, Calvin said it was \"a dream come true\" — the energy was incredible, he \"felt on top of the world\", and it was \"seriously surreal\" [S16T2][S16T3][S16T4].\n- On 2023-10-19, told Dave he has started touring with Frank Ocean (\"lots happened\" since they last talked) — \"it's been amazing\": so much energy from the crowd and \"such a connection when I'm on stage — unreal!\"; the tour \"has been great\" and \"jamming with Frank Ocean is a dream come true\" (another Frank Ocean tour after the earlier ones listed here — Dave is looking forward to attending one of its shows, see the 2023-10-19 entry in ## Relationships) [S24T1][S24T3].\n- On 2023-10-19, shared another photo of the tour crowd: a crowd of people at a concert with their hands in the air — \"Wow, the crowd energy is amazing! It always gets me so pumped and it's awesome. Look at that photo, that was awesome!\"; when Dave asked where it was taken, Calvin said it was taken in Tokyo during a concert — \"the energy was nuts - felt like the whole city came out!\" (Dave's enthusiasm about visiting Tokyo, see /memories/dave.md > ## Japan) [S24T9][S24T10][S24T11].\n- On 2023-10-19, announced he's actually going to Tokyo in November 2023 (\"next month\") after the tour ends — shared a photo of a city at night with a tall building in the background (\"What a great view!\") and said \"Sometimes I wish I could go back to places like [that]\"; spots he's excited to check out: Shibuya Crossing — \"like Tokyo's Times Square\" — and Shinjuku; he can't wait to try the amazing food there again (shared a photo of Shibuya Crossing at night — a crowd of people with umbrellas in the rain); he has never tried ramen but \"it's supposed to be awesome\" — \"Gonna give it a shot while in Tokyo!\" — after Dave (who tried ramen in Boston) encouraged him (Dave's side in /memories/dave.md > ## Japan) [S24T17][S24T19][S24T21].","text_sha256":"8136e3a35ca520de037967478d60d5a716b2b56a8185d1b60fadc35f31073090","timestamp":null}],"integrity":{"post_tree_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","pre_tree_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","store_unchanged":true,"verified":true},"metrics":{"completion_tokens":2253,"filesystem_tool_calls":7,"model_calls":7,"